WEBVTT

00:03.288 --> 00:04.180
Appraise.

00:04.180 --> 00:04.700
(Adamantine Strength (S+) —
Greatly boosts strength for 10 seconds.)

00:04.700 --> 00:05.360
(Steel Cutter (S+) Enhances weapon and
claw sharpness, allowing cuts through steel.)

00:06.757 --> 00:07.799
Oww!

00:07.799 --> 00:11.720
Now that you've acquired
Death Bear's ability,

00:11.720 --> 00:13.764
you must've gained
some confidence too.

00:14.348 --> 00:17.809
Now defeat the monsters
and pursue your way to the surface.

00:17.809 --> 00:19.269
Wait, does that mean...

00:19.269 --> 00:22.773
You have completed your training.
That's what it means.

00:26.151 --> 00:31.114
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

00:31.114 --> 00:35.911
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

00:35.911 --> 00:45.712
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

00:45.712 --> 00:50.467
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

00:50.467 --> 00:54.346
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

00:55.722 --> 00:59.643
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

00:59.643 --> 01:02.854
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

01:04.273 --> 01:09.027
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

01:09.027 --> 01:13.699
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

01:13.699 --> 01:15.951
♪See the world through my eyes♪

01:15.951 --> 01:18.287
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

01:18.287 --> 01:23.792
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

01:25.002 --> 01:29.381
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:29.840 --> 01:34.511
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

01:34.511 --> 01:39.391
♪Because you have given it to me♪

01:39.391 --> 01:46.189
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

01:57.909 --> 02:00.037
Rejoice in tears, you little child.

02:00.037 --> 02:03.977
For I will hand you a present from Yuri.

02:03.978 --> 02:06.543
Not with that face, no!

02:07.294 --> 02:10.297
This is the remain of
Yggdrasil's Spirit Core.

02:10.297 --> 02:14.343
Isn't that the one that is
imbued in my prosthetic eye?

02:14.343 --> 02:18.472
Exactly. This will allow me
to make you a new one.

02:18.472 --> 02:21.683
But, isn't this the source
of Yuri's power?

02:21.683 --> 02:24.269
I'm already receiving so much...

02:24.269 --> 02:26.271
I can't take all that's left!

02:26.271 --> 02:28.190
Don't get the wrong idea!

02:28.190 --> 02:30.317
We're merely loaning this to you.

02:30.317 --> 02:34.777
I've put a spell so that it will
return to us when you're dead.

02:34.778 --> 02:37.115
I'll do the transplant now.
Close your eyes.

02:37.115 --> 02:38.700
A-All right.

02:44.748 --> 02:46.041
There, done.

02:46.828 --> 02:48.627
I don't feel anything different.

02:48.627 --> 02:52.214
You will shed tears of joy to the
evolved Spirit's Prosthetic Eye, rather...

02:52.714 --> 02:56.510
...the Divine Spirit's Prosthetic Eye's
wondrous performance...

02:56.510 --> 02:58.720
...if you allow it some time, surely.

02:58.720 --> 03:00.764
Divine Spirit's Prosthetic Eye?

03:01.723 --> 03:05.227
I think I also owe you my gratitude, Yuri.
You gave me the strength to...

03:06.269 --> 03:08.480
Wait, where's Yuri?

03:08.480 --> 03:11.149
Hey. I'm here.

03:11.149 --> 03:14.361
What? Huh?
Where did you come from?

03:14.361 --> 03:17.973
I came from your eye, Ein.

03:18.490 --> 03:21.159
Now that the core has been
transplanted entirely,

03:21.159 --> 03:24.037
your eye is now the same as Yggdrasil.

03:24.037 --> 03:27.499
Which is why Yuri can reside in it.

03:27.499 --> 03:31.002
Rejoice!
For Yuri will be staying with you.

03:31.002 --> 03:33.171
I can heal you!

03:33.171 --> 03:37.008
Use as much Yggdrasil Drops as you want.
I'll be sure to be of help.

03:37.533 --> 03:40.553
I mean, I'm happy with that,

03:40.554 --> 03:42.431
but are you fine with this, Ursula?

03:44.266 --> 03:45.893
Of course I'm not!

03:45.894 --> 03:50.772
I won't leave my precious daughter
to some unknown, useless human!

03:51.233 --> 03:52.716
Then, why?

03:53.316 --> 03:54.651
You see...

03:54.651 --> 03:58.238
Ever since Yuri was born here,
it's always been just the two of us.

03:58.238 --> 04:02.659
She had no friends and was always lonely.

04:03.326 --> 04:07.664
So, I thought I could entrust
this child to you.

04:07.664 --> 04:12.419
You may be a dunce at heart,
but you do have a kind soul.

04:12.419 --> 04:15.547
Show Yuri how vast
the world is with that eye.

04:17.487 --> 04:18.633
Ursula...

04:19.926 --> 04:21.261
Understood.

04:21.261 --> 04:24.639
You can entrust your
precious daughter to me!

04:24.639 --> 04:28.435
Hold on tightly to those words
and that determination.

04:29.436 --> 04:32.314
Here's a parting gift for you, kid.
Give me your hand.

04:37.319 --> 04:39.237
Wh-What is this?

04:39.237 --> 04:43.074
I gave your hand the magic
of Infinite Storage.

04:43.074 --> 04:46.953
You can store objects without
restrictions in that crest at will.

04:47.704 --> 04:50.457
Here, store this right away.

04:50.457 --> 04:51.500
This is...

04:51.500 --> 04:54.711
I crafted this using the
materials that Yuri provided.

04:55.378 --> 04:56.713
It is the Spirit Sword.

04:56.713 --> 04:59.007
Huh? You're giving me that too?

04:59.007 --> 05:01.343
Yes, but before that...

05:02.469 --> 05:04.721
Argh! It hurts!

05:04.721 --> 05:06.139
I'll heal you!

05:07.974 --> 05:10.227
Then you swallow this Sage's Stone.

05:11.978 --> 05:13.855
Come on! Swallow it!

05:19.402 --> 05:21.238
U-Ursula?

05:21.238 --> 05:23.323
What did you do to my right eye!?

05:23.323 --> 05:26.076
It's a device that links
my consciousness to you.

05:26.076 --> 05:32.123
This will allow us to communicate anytime
and allow me to see what you see.

05:32.123 --> 05:34.501
Wait, does that mean...

05:34.501 --> 05:39.214
I'll be watching you to make sure
you don't get too friendly with Yuri.

05:39.215 --> 05:41.466
This is going to be so awkward!

05:42.678 --> 05:44.536
With this, I'm all set.

05:44.928 --> 05:47.889
Now I just need to escape
to the ground level.

05:49.083 --> 05:53.186
Speaking of which, is there anything
you'd like to do once we're up top?

05:53.186 --> 05:54.980
Anything I'd like to do?

05:54.980 --> 05:57.691
Yeah. I want to repay all
the kindness you gave to me.

05:59.150 --> 06:01.069
I want to meet my family.

06:01.069 --> 06:03.280
Your family?
The one besides Ursula?

06:04.155 --> 06:07.242
I want to meet my younger
and elder sisters.

06:08.326 --> 06:11.663
Yggdrasil was originally
a single big tree.

06:12.247 --> 06:15.083
Its branches and spirit cores
were divided into nine parts,

06:15.083 --> 06:17.294
and hidden in dungeons across the land.

06:17.294 --> 06:18.628
I see...

06:18.628 --> 06:22.257
So, she used to live
with the other Yggdrasils.

06:23.508 --> 06:26.511
All right, I got it!
If that's the case, then...

06:27.774 --> 06:31.766
Let's travel around the world
and search for your family!

06:33.643 --> 06:35.186
Are you sure?

06:35.186 --> 06:37.022
Won't it trouble you?

06:37.022 --> 06:41.192
No way! I'd also love to
meet your family.

06:41.860 --> 06:44.529
Come on, let's go meet 'em all.

06:44.529 --> 06:46.907
Thank you so much, Ein!

06:47.574 --> 06:48.909
Now that it's decided,

06:49.534 --> 06:51.161
let's get out of here first!

06:51.161 --> 06:52.287
Yes!

06:59.252 --> 07:02.672
If only I knew
which way to go...

07:02.672 --> 07:03.924
There, to the left.

07:03.924 --> 07:06.635
Whoa, Ursula.
Are we telecommunicating?

07:06.635 --> 07:09.137
I have appraised the escape route.

07:09.137 --> 07:11.765
Follow the arrows and you won't get lost.

07:11.765 --> 07:12.265
What?

07:12.265 --> 07:15.060
Also, an enemy is approaching.

07:15.060 --> 07:18.521
It's a Viper. A giant serpent
with all kinds of anomalies...

07:18.521 --> 07:20.941
Wait, hold on, Ursula!

07:20.941 --> 07:24.235
Can the Divine Spirit's Prosthetic Eye
even appraise that?

07:24.235 --> 07:25.278
Obviously.

07:25.278 --> 07:27.781
Enough dilly-dallying
and get ready to fight!

07:27.781 --> 07:29.324
Lose, and I'll kill you.

07:29.324 --> 07:30.283
Okay, okay...

07:30.825 --> 07:35.288
It's reassuring to have support with
using this eye I barely know how to use.

07:37.944 --> 07:38.875
You know...

07:38.875 --> 07:42.045
I feel like it's getting easier
to beat the S-ranks.

07:42.545 --> 07:44.843
While you were
getting carried away,

07:44.844 --> 07:47.258
I went ahead and
appraised its abilities.

07:47.258 --> 07:48.385
What? Hey! Wait!

07:48.385 --> 07:51.221
You can now resist all status ailments
with Resilience

07:51.221 --> 07:55.725
and melt anything you touch
with Dissolution Poison.

07:55.725 --> 07:58.770
I wasn't mentally prepared!

07:58.770 --> 08:01.272
I bet it's going to be pain...

08:01.272 --> 08:02.399
...less?

08:03.066 --> 08:05.819
Huh? What about the
post-appraisal headache?

08:05.819 --> 08:07.946
I healed it!

08:07.946 --> 08:11.366
Huh? Does this mean I won't have
to suffer from headaches anymore?

08:11.366 --> 08:11.908
Yep.

08:11.908 --> 08:14.285
I can't thank you enough, Yuri!

08:14.285 --> 08:18.039
I'm beyond grateful to have met you.

08:21.598 --> 08:24.004
That looks like a dangerous door.

08:24.004 --> 08:27.507
Too bad you won't reach the surface
unless you don't go through there.

08:27.507 --> 08:32.637
Listen well, each dungeon has
a master known as a Boss Monster.

08:33.024 --> 08:35.420
A dungeon is a creature
that devours people.

08:35.421 --> 08:38.546
And just like any creature,
it has a heart.

08:38.547 --> 08:40.645
The Dungeon Core is exactly that.

08:40.645 --> 08:43.857
However, it'd be a problem
if its heart were easily destroyed.

08:43.857 --> 08:46.609
Therefore, a guardian is needed.

08:47.022 --> 08:50.405
So the Boss Monster is the guardian
of the Dungeon Core, huh?

08:50.405 --> 08:51.531
Indeed.

08:51.531 --> 08:55.004
Unless you defeat the master,
the door to the exit won't open.

08:55.118 --> 08:58.288
And the master is,
without a doubt, strong.

08:59.164 --> 09:01.182
Thanks to the both of them,

09:01.183 --> 09:04.085
I've become strong enough
to defeat S-rank monsters.

09:04.711 --> 09:09.049
But a boss monster's strength
should be on a whole other level.

09:09.049 --> 09:12.427
I don't want to imagine
what will happen if I lose...

09:13.887 --> 09:15.680
You will be okay.

09:16.973 --> 09:19.559
I believe that you'll be fine, Ein!

09:20.261 --> 09:21.336
Yuri...

09:23.562 --> 09:26.440
Just quickly defeat it
and get to the surface, ya fool.

09:26.441 --> 09:27.567
Ursula...

09:27.567 --> 09:30.070
That's right. I'm different now.

09:30.070 --> 09:35.158
I'm not that rubbish picker Ein who could
only desperately run away waiting to die.

09:36.034 --> 09:40.121
I'm Ein, the Appraiser,
blessed by Yggdrasil.

09:44.247 --> 09:47.212
That's the heart of this dungeon...

09:47.212 --> 09:48.296
The Dungeon Core.

09:49.172 --> 09:50.298
What is that?

09:50.298 --> 09:53.301
Is this... a summoning magic circle?!

10:02.310 --> 10:04.813
What a huge creature.
That thing must be...

10:05.605 --> 10:07.315
The Boss Monster.

10:07.716 --> 10:09.818
It's dangerous,
Yuri, get inside the eye!

10:09.818 --> 10:10.819
Got it!

10:13.154 --> 10:14.572
I'll win this!

10:14.572 --> 10:17.158
There's too big a gap in size.

10:17.158 --> 10:19.452
First, get inside its guard.

10:19.452 --> 10:20.370
Roger!

10:23.790 --> 10:26.459
Two seconds to impact.
Brace yourself.

10:26.835 --> 10:27.794
Let's do this!

10:30.130 --> 10:31.589
Adamantine Strength!

10:34.509 --> 10:37.345
Whoa, what the heck is this?
Is this...

10:37.929 --> 10:39.389
Is this a meteor or what?!

10:45.770 --> 10:47.230
I'll heal you now!

10:47.230 --> 10:48.565
Sorry, Yuri!

10:49.274 --> 10:53.027
The past me would've
freaked out and frozen in fear.

10:53.027 --> 10:55.947
Unlike now. I've changed!

10:55.947 --> 10:57.574
Dissolution Poison!

11:05.248 --> 11:06.332
Did I get it?

11:20.930 --> 11:22.557
That was a close call...

11:22.557 --> 11:25.435
Dammit. Guess it won't be that easy, huh?

11:25.435 --> 11:30.523
Then, kid, I'm giving you permission
to use the Ultimate Magic I taught you.

11:30.523 --> 11:31.566
Are you sure?

11:31.566 --> 11:33.620
With the amount of mana you have now,

11:33.621 --> 11:36.529
you should be able to
fire it at least once.

11:36.529 --> 11:38.907
Even if you collapse, Yuri will heal you.

11:38.907 --> 11:40.658
Use your full strength.

11:41.242 --> 11:42.076
Got it.

11:51.127 --> 11:52.378
Too slow.

11:58.635 --> 12:01.137
Nova Strike!

12:17.862 --> 12:19.030
Did I...

12:19.030 --> 12:21.532
Did I win?

12:22.492 --> 12:24.577
Amazing! That was amazing!

12:24.577 --> 12:27.455
It's amazing that you beat
a creature that big!

12:27.455 --> 12:29.040
I couldn't believe I did it...

12:29.749 --> 12:33.044
I alone would never
be able to pull this off.

12:34.671 --> 12:35.797
Thank you so much.

12:35.797 --> 12:37.674
It's all thanks to you, Yuri!

12:39.092 --> 12:41.135
Oi, you son of a gun!

12:41.135 --> 12:44.347
Why don't you hurry up
and appraise the golem already, huh?!

12:44.347 --> 12:45.660
Oh, right.

12:45.660 --> 12:46.130
(Resistance: Earth Attribute (A))

12:46.130 --> 12:46.990
(Grants resistance to Earth-based
physical and magical attacks.)

12:46.990 --> 12:47.058
(Surprise Attack Nullification (S+))

12:47.058 --> 12:47.510
(Surprise Attack Nullification (S+))
Hey, kid. You forgot one more thing to appraise.

12:47.510 --> 12:48.720
(Activates when hit by a surprise attack,
greatly boosting defense and nullifying damage.)
Hey, kid. You forgot one more thing to appraise.

12:48.720 --> 12:49.060
(Gravity Pressure (S+))
Hey, kid. You forgot one more thing to appraise.

12:49.060 --> 12:50.260
(Creates a gravity field to immobilize opponents
and force flying enemies to the ground.)
Hey, kid. You forgot one more thing to appraise.

12:50.260 --> 12:50.620
(Immovable Fortress (S+))
Hey, kid. You forgot one more thing to appraise.

12:50.620 --> 12:50.812
(Prevents movement, completely nullifying
all physical and magical attacks.)
Hey, kid. You forgot one more thing to appraise.

12:50.812 --> 12:51.650
(Prevents movement, completely nullifying
all physical and magical attacks.)
Huh?

12:51.650 --> 12:52.021
Huh?

12:52.021 --> 12:54.065
That Dungeon Core over there.

12:55.400 --> 12:57.443
What'll happen if I appraise—

12:58.987 --> 13:01.823
U-Ursula?
Why are you here?

13:01.823 --> 13:05.034
Your left eye is now
as powerful as Yggdrasil.

13:05.034 --> 13:09.330
That's why I can transfer
to your side and only near you.

13:10.456 --> 13:11.791
I see.

13:11.791 --> 13:16.004
Looks like Dungeon Cores
are similar to Spirit Cores.

13:16.004 --> 13:18.214
What do you mean by that?

13:18.214 --> 13:23.094
To put it simply, the Dungeon Core
can be used to enhance your eye.

13:23.535 --> 13:27.347
My already high-performance eye
can be evolved even further?

13:27.348 --> 13:31.311
What will it be? I can enhance it
right away if you like.

13:31.311 --> 13:34.105
By all means. Please do.

13:44.324 --> 13:45.410
Whoa. It leveled up to level two!

13:45.410 --> 13:46.610
(Divine Spirit's Prosthetic Eye (Level 2))
Whoa. It leveled up to level two!

13:46.610 --> 13:47.060
(Grants the ability to appraise the timing
to reflect enemy attacks.)
Whoa. It leveled up to level two!

13:47.060 --> 13:47.076
Whoa. It leveled up to level two!

13:47.076 --> 13:51.205
Keep defeating Boss Monsters
and absorbing their Dungeon Cores,

13:51.205 --> 13:53.583
and you'll be able to
strengthen yourself more!

14:00.161 --> 14:01.966
It just closed on its own!

14:01.966 --> 14:04.969
Does this mean
we can't go back anymore?

14:04.969 --> 14:08.056
Perhaps because the Dungeon Core was lost,

14:08.056 --> 14:10.975
the route to Yggdrasil
has been sealed off.

14:10.975 --> 14:14.812
By now, the hole you fell into
has probably been sealed as well.

14:14.812 --> 14:16.856
So, does that mean...

14:16.856 --> 14:23.529
With this, no one will come to
Yggdrasil anymore.

14:23.529 --> 14:26.324
Yuri can now live peacefully from now on.

14:26.324 --> 14:27.742
That's relieving.

14:27.742 --> 14:32.246
I see. If that's the case, then I can
leave for the surface with no regrets.

14:32.497 --> 14:34.999
Let's go, Yuri, Ursula!

14:34.999 --> 14:36.250
Yes!

14:46.427 --> 14:51.224
I heard about it. The enemy you ran into
was apparently really dangerous.

14:51.224 --> 14:54.018
Is that true, Zoid?

14:54.018 --> 14:57.230
Yeah, you should never go there.

14:58.668 --> 15:01.651
After all, there are
hellhounds everywhere.

15:01.651 --> 15:03.486
If you're going, be prepared to die.

15:03.486 --> 15:06.030
How did you manage to come back
from a hell like that?

15:06.531 --> 15:08.866
Ein, he told me himself...

15:09.616 --> 15:12.869
He told me to leave it to him
and go on ahead...

15:12.870 --> 15:15.415
Seriously? That rubbish picker said that?

15:15.415 --> 15:17.125
Don't call him that!

15:18.167 --> 15:20.420
He was a brave man!

15:20.420 --> 15:24.132
He protected us and stood as a shield for us.

15:24.132 --> 15:26.050
S-Sorry...

15:26.050 --> 15:27.635
How unfortunate...

15:27.635 --> 15:30.638
Well, that was a lie, of course.

15:30.638 --> 15:33.724
The truth of what happened
back then is only known to us.

15:33.724 --> 15:36.269
Dead men tell no tales.

15:36.936 --> 15:38.723
Now that I've portrayed him as a hero,

15:38.724 --> 15:41.441
he's probably smiling
down at me from heaven.

15:41.441 --> 15:46.446
Forgive me, Ein!
I will never forget your sacrifice.

15:47.238 --> 15:48.823
Who's dead?

15:48.823 --> 15:50.450
"Who", you said? Of course it's...

15:51.409 --> 15:52.618
Ein?!

15:53.620 --> 15:55.788
How are you alive?!

15:55.788 --> 15:57.832
Y-You were supposed to be dead!

15:57.832 --> 15:59.250
As you can see, I'm not.

15:59.250 --> 16:01.794
That's insane! How did you
get out of there?!

16:01.794 --> 16:03.713
Well, I defeated monsters as I walked.

16:03.713 --> 16:05.590
I ain't buying that!

16:05.590 --> 16:08.718
There's no way you could have
taken down those monsters!

16:10.344 --> 16:12.138
H-Hey, Zoid.

16:12.138 --> 16:12.847
What?

16:13.389 --> 16:18.352
Why aren't you happy?
Your savior is back, dude.

16:20.188 --> 16:22.356
His savior, now?

16:22.356 --> 16:28.112
Zoid and Jolene paralyzed me
and used me as bait for the hellhounds.

16:28.559 --> 16:30.072
What the heck?!

16:30.072 --> 16:31.949
You lied to us?!

16:31.949 --> 16:35.077
N-No, he lied to make me look bad...

16:35.077 --> 16:38.372
Why would he drag down someone he saved?!

16:38.372 --> 16:40.791
I, uh...

16:40.791 --> 16:41.876
You scumbag!

16:41.876 --> 16:43.461
- Murderer!
- Piece of trash!

16:43.461 --> 16:45.171
- What were you thinking?!
- You bastard!

16:45.172 --> 16:45.880
Get out!

16:45.880 --> 16:47.381
That's enough!

16:47.381 --> 16:49.951
In the end, I'm still alive.

16:50.616 --> 16:55.264
Zoid was the only one who accepted me
despite being a useless outcast.

16:55.890 --> 16:57.266
Besides...

16:57.266 --> 17:01.270
It was because I was left behind
that I met Yuri and Ursula.

17:03.898 --> 17:05.650
Thank you for everything.

17:08.152 --> 17:11.239
He's thanking someone
who almost killed him?

17:11.239 --> 17:13.658
Ein has sure changed, huh...

17:13.658 --> 17:15.952
Is he really the same Ein we know?

17:15.952 --> 17:17.954
He's like a completely
different person.

17:24.877 --> 17:26.990
When I was in a dungeon
near the royal capital,

17:26.990 --> 17:27.004
(Level Drain (S) Lowers the level of
anyone you touch, weakening them.)
When I was in a dungeon
near the royal capital,

17:27.004 --> 17:27.660
(Level Drain (S) Lowers the level of
anyone you touch, weakening them.)
I defeated a boss monster
and gained its abilities.

17:27.660 --> 17:27.670
I defeated a boss monster
and gained its abilities.

17:27.670 --> 17:28.450
(Magic Seal (S) Absorbs the magical power of
anyone you touch, preventing magic use.)
I defeated a boss monster
and gained its abilities.

17:28.450 --> 17:28.970
(Dispel (S) Removes all curses
and abnormal conditions.)
I defeated a boss monster
and gained its abilities.

17:28.970 --> 17:29.980
(Faint (A) Interferes with the mind of anyone
you touch, causing them to faint.)
I defeated a boss monster
and gained its abilities.

17:30.007 --> 17:32.510
Amazing! It evolved again!

17:32.910 --> 17:33.770
Does this mean I can read any text now?

17:33.770 --> 17:34.940
(Divine Spirit's Prosthetic Eye (Level 3))
Does this mean I can read any text now?

17:34.940 --> 17:36.000
(Grants the ability to decipher all scripts
across all eras and races.)

17:36.013 --> 17:38.432
That dungeon was a bust too.

17:38.432 --> 17:41.018
It wasn't the dungeon with
the Yggdrasil either.

17:41.018 --> 17:44.188
Such dungeons were never
meant to be easily found.

17:44.188 --> 17:46.941
Yggdrasil is a tree
that supports this world.

17:46.942 --> 17:49.527
It would be a problem
if it were easily found.

17:49.886 --> 17:51.309
I'm sorry, Yuri.

17:51.310 --> 17:54.198
It's going to take a while
to reunite you with your family.

17:54.198 --> 17:58.160
It's okay, Ein. Take your time.

17:58.160 --> 18:00.688
I'm the one being selfish here...

18:02.164 --> 18:03.207
What is that?

18:03.207 --> 18:07.003
It seems that a carriage up ahead
is being attacked by monsters.

18:07.003 --> 18:08.504
W-We have to save them!

18:08.505 --> 18:09.547
You're right.

18:09.547 --> 18:11.173
Yuri, get inside the eye!

18:17.130 --> 18:19.120
(Resistance: Ice Attribute) (A)

18:19.120 --> 18:21.120
(Flight) (A)

18:24.520 --> 18:26.522
Um, are you okay?

18:32.737 --> 18:34.447
Are you hurt?

18:35.281 --> 18:38.117
I found you! My...

18:38.117 --> 18:40.870
My hero!

18:40.870 --> 18:43.289
H-Hero?

18:43.289 --> 18:46.292
Uh, are you his brother?

18:46.292 --> 18:48.004
Do something about her, please.

18:48.005 --> 18:51.239
No, young man.
I am not her brother.

18:51.672 --> 18:55.551
My name is Jasper, and I am
the head of the Merchant Guild.

18:55.551 --> 18:57.762
And that person there...

18:57.762 --> 19:02.808
Is the third princess of this country,
Princess Claudia von Gayta Neega.

19:05.019 --> 19:09.065
Thank you so much for saving us this time.

19:09.065 --> 19:12.026
Oh, no, if you're thanking someone,
it should be Yuri.

19:12.026 --> 19:15.279
It was her who treated
your subordinates, Your Highness.

19:15.279 --> 19:19.325
Is that so?
Yuri, thank you very much.

19:19.325 --> 19:22.703
I will properly address my gratitude
to everyone at a later date.

19:23.561 --> 19:26.247
There's no need to be so formal.

19:26.248 --> 19:28.709
Please feel free to call me Claudia.

19:28.709 --> 19:29.710
Understood.

19:29.710 --> 19:34.215
Now then, let's leave the
formalities here for now.

19:34.215 --> 19:36.342
Oh, my hero!

19:36.342 --> 19:38.844
Y-You can't do that!

19:38.844 --> 19:40.846
Oh, why is that?

19:40.846 --> 19:43.849
Huh? Well, because...

19:44.238 --> 19:45.851
I...

19:46.394 --> 19:48.521
I am...

19:49.605 --> 19:51.440
...Ein's...

19:52.108 --> 19:54.610
...spouse!

19:56.362 --> 19:57.113
What?

19:57.113 --> 20:00.449
Oh, if that case, then
there's no problem at all.

20:00.991 --> 20:03.994
I'll just become his second.

20:03.994 --> 20:06.914
Y-You are not giving up?!

20:06.914 --> 20:08.999
Why would I?

20:08.999 --> 20:14.004
Having multiple wives for one husband
is nothing unusual these days, you know.

20:14.004 --> 20:15.881
Is this the norm out here...

20:15.881 --> 20:19.385
- I'm glad she already made friends...
- But you can't touch Ein! Touch me instead!

20:19.385 --> 20:21.387
- I can't keep up at all.
- Understood!

20:21.764 --> 20:25.433
Young man. I have something
I'd like to discuss with you.

20:25.433 --> 20:26.892
What is it, Jasper?

20:27.393 --> 20:29.770
I want you to marry me.

20:30.354 --> 20:32.022
What?!

20:32.022 --> 20:33.816
What do you mean?

20:34.400 --> 20:36.026
Let me explain it to you in order.

20:37.194 --> 20:41.031
I am the leader of the guild called
Silver Phoenix Trading Company.

20:41.031 --> 20:43.617
S-Silver Phoenix Trading Company?!

20:43.617 --> 20:46.746
The products from your place
are everywhere!

20:47.580 --> 20:49.915
I'm honored that you know about us.

20:53.878 --> 20:56.797
So many sparkling jewels!

20:56.797 --> 21:00.885
I collect and safeguard every
gemstone in this world.

21:00.885 --> 21:04.555
I believe it is my duty to
preserve that brilliance for eternity.

21:05.264 --> 21:08.017
Your left eye is a Spirit Core, right?

21:09.560 --> 21:13.022
The Spirit Core,
the source of the Yggdrasil's power.

21:13.022 --> 21:15.566
Do you know about that legend?

21:15.566 --> 21:17.443
L-Legend?

21:17.443 --> 21:20.946
The Yggdrasil that once
existed on the surface...

21:21.489 --> 21:25.785
...was the calamity by the Demon King,
Miktoran, who sought world destruction.

21:26.702 --> 21:30.122
It's said that in order to seal him,
it exhausted all its power,

21:30.623 --> 21:34.335
leaving behind only the Spirit Core,
and withered away.

21:35.586 --> 21:37.963
Miktoran, the Demon King?

21:38.547 --> 21:41.349
So the reason
Yggdrasil on the surface was lost

21:41.350 --> 21:44.470
was to seal away that Demon King?

21:44.470 --> 21:48.098
I've been searching for
the Spirit Core all this time,

21:48.098 --> 21:50.726
and then you appeared.

21:50.726 --> 21:55.731
Your very eye captivated me in an instant.

21:56.232 --> 21:57.483
Oh, young man.

21:57.800 --> 21:59.860
Would you please allow me...

21:59.860 --> 22:03.113
...to be reflected in your eyes
for all eternity?

22:03.113 --> 22:04.156
Too close!

22:05.783 --> 22:07.910
Hey, come over here for a second!

22:07.910 --> 22:08.577
Ursula?

22:09.245 --> 22:11.747
What are you planning to do
about his offer?

22:11.747 --> 22:13.582
What do I plan to do?
I'll decline, of course.

22:13.582 --> 22:15.584
Think it through, you fool.

22:15.584 --> 22:18.629
He's been searching for
the Spirit Core for many years,

22:18.629 --> 22:23.217
so he probably has a lot of
information about the Yggdrasil.

22:23.217 --> 22:28.097
If you marry him, you'll gain both
wealth and information.

22:28.097 --> 22:33.143
The chances of finding hidden dungeons
will likely increase as well.

22:33.143 --> 22:35.104
That is totally the face of a villain!

22:38.007 --> 22:41.527
A marriage might be difficult,

22:41.527 --> 22:43.904
but would you mind
staying as friends?

22:43.904 --> 22:46.448
Well, for now, that's fine with me.

22:46.448 --> 22:47.491
For now.

22:47.491 --> 22:50.619
Also, you can live in this mansion,
starting today.

22:51.120 --> 22:54.498
This will eventually
become your home, after all.

22:54.498 --> 22:58.335
That's unfair, Jasper!
I want to join too!

22:58.335 --> 23:00.504
M-Me too!

23:01.130 --> 23:05.509
Say, Jasper, do you have any information
about the other Spirit Cores?

23:05.509 --> 23:09.054
I do have some,
but they're in dangerous areas.

23:09.054 --> 23:10.848
It's hard to conduct proper research.

23:10.848 --> 23:13.893
Would you mind sharing those with me?

23:14.476 --> 23:16.937
We might be able
to obtain another Spirit Core.

23:16.937 --> 23:18.397
Another Spirit Core?

23:19.648 --> 23:21.233
I will arrange for it immediately!

23:35.873 --> 23:38.417
Next Episode: Looking for Sisters.

23:38.417 --> 23:40.410
(Next Episode: Looking for Sisters)
